{"about_the_game":"<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802490/extras/Steam_AboutSectionSeparator_1.png?t=1753307223\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802490/extras/MagmachineryFullRound_v2.gif?t=1753307223\" /></div><br>The Quizard\u2019s Domain is the world\u2019s first true Battle Quiz, fusing classic, choice-based trivia game elements with exciting real-time arena combat! <br>Knowing the answer to each question will get you far, but it won\u2019t be your only skill that\u2019s put to the test. <br>Time is constantly ticking away as you run, float, jump, fly, and use all kinds of versatile abilities to fight for dominance in each unique arena. <br><br><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802490/extras/Steam_AboutSectionSeparator_2.png?t=1753307223\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802490/extras/InteractionMedley.gif?t=1753307223\" /></div><br>Think you know the answer? Better book it over there before someone blocks your spot.<br>No idea what it might be? Watch opponents to predict where they\u2019re going and get there first.<br>Make use of your strengths and head straight to your goal. <br>Abuse your opponent\u2019s weaknesses to stop them in their tracks. <br>Or hide your plans and lead other players astray by repositioning at the last second. <br>You decide anew how you want to smash your way to victory in every fast-paced round!<br><br><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802490/extras/Steam_AboutSectionSeparator_3.png?t=1753307223\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802490/extras/Flora_Demo_steam.gif?t=1753307223\" /></div><br>Whether you\u2019re here to learn, show off your knowledge of a topic, or simply dunk on the competition, you\u2019ll be able to do it in style. <br>Agility and archery, control over frightening eldritch powers, and many other skillsets let you play to your own strengths.<br>The already diverse roster of characters and worlds will keep expanding with free post-launch updates, alongside new game modes, customization options, and much more!","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2802490?t=1753307223","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802490/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753307223","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802490/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753307223","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802490/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753307223","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3032770,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>NEW PLAYABLE CHARACTER!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hey, friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet <u><strong>Roger Ribbit</strong></u>,\u00a0a very special addition to the roster, in honor of The Frog Cult and Spelkollektivet's Froggy Sale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=